.TH start-cli-registry-package-access-restrict 1  "restrict "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-registry\-package\-access\-restrict \- Make a package private, readable by exactly the signers holding the given keys
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli registry package access restrict\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIID\fR> [\fIREADERS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Make a package private, readable by exactly the signers holding the given keys
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIID\fR>
Package identifier
.TP
[\fIREADERS\fR]
Public keys of the registered signers who may read the package, in PEM, DER Base64, or armored OpenPGP format
